    "sub_ename": "CONSTRUCTION MANAGEMENT",
    "describe_ch": "本課程著重於如何認識建築相關領域產業之經營與管理。重點課程1/2著重於企業經營管理之認114著重際企業訪之互動、1/4建築創新思維之提案,為課程三大主軸。",
    "describe_eh": "This course focuses on how to understand the operation and management of construction-related industries.  1/2 of the key courses focuses on the understanding of enterprise operation and management, 1/4 on the interaction of actual company visits, and 1/4 on the proposal of innovative thinking in architecture, which are the three main axes of the course.",
